  title: Pipe Maintenance
  bodyText: 'Infrastructure teams report minor pipe leaks within the residential
    areas following routine repairs. Municipal authorities assure residents that
    water quality remains completely safe.

    

    Lead Plumber Piper Downe
    estimates that the maintenance should be done within the day unless any major
    issues arise.'
  headliner: <b>Residential Water System Maintenance Undergoing in Main Street</b>
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - You can come fix my pipes if ya know what i mean.
  - IS THIS WHY MY SPRINKLERS HAVEN'T BEEN WATERING MY LAWN ?!
  - Hopefully they fix it quickly, my supply is running low !
